<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<!--
=========================================================
玹翔旅遊｜舊會員登入頁輕量轉址
新手小白維護重點：
1. 真正登入頁是 login.html。
2. 這頁只保留舊網址導流，避免客人從舊連結進來看到 404。
3. Header / Footer 仍由 site-layout.js 注入，導覽列不會分家。
=========================================================
-->
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=login.html">
<title>會員登入轉址中｜玹翔旅遊</title>
<meta name="description" content="玹翔旅遊會員登入頁已整併，正在前往新版登入頁。">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://xuanxiangtravel.com/login.html">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/xx-v8.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/xx-enterprise-v10.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/s2o-upgrade.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/xx-v92-s2o-fix.css">
</head>
<body data-xx-layout="v8">
<div id="xx-site-header"></div>
<main style="width:min(760px,calc(100% - 32px));margin:64px auto">
  <h1>會員登入頁已整併</h1>
  <p>正在前往新版登入頁。若瀏覽器沒有自動轉址，請點擊 <a href="login.html">前往會員登入</a>。</p>
  <p><a class="btn primary" href="login.html">前往會員登入</a> <a class="btn" href="member-center.html">會員中心</a></p>
</main><script src="assets/js/pricing-freeze.js" defer></script>

<div id="xx-site-footer"></div>
<div id="xx-site-floating"></div>

<script src="assets/js/config.js"></script>
<script src="assets/js/site-layout.js"></script>
<script src="assets/js/site.js"></script>
<script src="assets/js/xx-enterprise-v10.js"></script>

<script src="assets/js/s2o-lightbox.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
